      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;libguestfs is a set of tools for accessing and modifying virtual machine (VM) disk images.  You can use this to inject files, resize, rescue, create, view or audit disks.  libguestfs is also a library that you can link to management programs written in C, Perl, Python, Ruby, Java and other languages.  In this talk, Richard Jones will&#xA;introduce the tools and give live demonstrations.  He also talks about how they work behind the scenes.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
